                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/8292: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-10-24T12:00:00-05:00">October 24,
                        1936—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>255. Your 511, October 23, 5 p.m. Department and Navy Department approve. Navy
                    Department states that captain possesses authority to make such transfer. Please
                    take complete and effective precautions that there be no publicity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
